# Purpose
Explains the safe user workflow for adding an AI agent credential such as Claude
or Codex without exposing secret values.

# Key Sections
- What the credential is for.
- Before adding it.
- Add and verify workflow.
- Troubleshooting and safety notes.

# Dependencies
